# noHXW — No Hardware, No Problem

**Distributed Infrastructure Simulation Engine**

A gamified, full-stack learning platform that takes you from **Green Bean** to **Principal Engineer** and beyond. No hardware required — just your curiosity and a browser.

---

## 📚 21 Lessons Across 5 Tracks

| Track | Lessons | Description |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| 🐍 **Python Path** | 16 | From zero to algorithmic problem-solving |
| 🟨 **JavaScript Journey** | 9 | Web fundamentals and array manipulation |
| 📝 **Pseudo Prep** | 6 | Logic without syntax — perfect for absolute beginners |
| 🌟 **Challenge Mode** | 4 | Interview-style algorithm problems |
| 💡 **Quiz Corner** | 2 | Computer science theory and web knowledge |

### Lesson Types
- **code** — Write functions that pass test cases
- **debug** — Find and fix bugs in broken code
- **quiz** — Answer CS theory questions

---

## 🏅 Career Progression

Every level unlocks a new title with a corresponding message celebrating your growth:

| Level | Title | Description |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| 1 | Green Bean 🫘 | Fresh start, eager to grow |
| 3 | Code Padawan 🌱 | The journey has begun |
| 5 | Apprentice 🔧 | Learning the tools of the trade |
| 8 | Junior Engineer ⚡ | Making commits, gaining confidence |
| 12 | Developer 💻 | Competent and curious |
| 16 | Proficient Engineer ⚙️ | Patterns emerge, skills sharpen |
| 21 | Senior Engineer 🏗️ | Seen some things, built some things |
| 27 | Staff Engineer 🧠 | Architect of solutions, mentor of peers |
| 33 | Principal Engineer 🎯 | Shapes the technical direction |
| 40 | Distinguished Engineer 🌟 | Pushes boundaries, sets standards |
| 50 | Fellow 👑 | Thought leader, industry influencer |
| 65 | Chief Technology Officer 🏛️ | Visionary leader |
| 80 | Grand Master 🧙 | The wisdom keeper |
| 100 | The KAHMF 🏆 | You've become the mentor |

### Other Gamification
- **XP & Streaks** — Earn XP for passing tests, build daily streaks for bonus multipliers
- **🏆 15 Achievements** — From "First Steps" to "Polyglot" and beyond
- **🎯 Level-up messages** — Unique, encouraging messages at every career milestone

---

## 🌐 Multi-Language Support

| Language | Executor | Lessons |
|----------|----------|---------|
| 🐍 Python | Sandboxed `exec()` with restricted globals | 16 |
| 🟨 JavaScript | Node.js subprocess with JSON serialization | 9 |
| 📝 Pseudocode | Pattern-matched interpretive runner | 6 |

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Option 1: Install as a pip package (recommended)
```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/kylerobertschuster/noHXW.git
cd noHXW

# Install noHXW (makes the `noxhw` CLI available)
pip install -e .

# Start the server
noxhw
```

### Option 2: Lightweight (dependencies only)
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --port 3000
```

### Option 3: Using Make
```bash
make install   # pip install -e .
make run       # noxhw (starts server)
```

### Option 4: npm
```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Then open **http://localhost:3000** in your browser.

---

## 🏛️ Architecture

```
noHXW/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py              FastAPI server (10+ endpoints)
│   ├── lab_injector.py      21 lessons, 5 tracks, 3 lesson types
│   ├── executor.py          Multi-language sandboxed execution
│   ├── state.py             Gamified state engine (XP, streaks, levels)
│   ├── achievements.py      15 achievements, 14 career titles, progression messages
│   ├── languages.py         Language runtimes and configurations
│   └── static/
│       └── index.html       Full gamified single-page frontend
├── AGENTS.md                Agent instructions and architecture overview
├── package.json             npm scripts
└── requirements.txt         Python dependencies
```

